B = [
('Schwinn','North America','1950s-60s','bicycles','In the style of Schwinn, heavy, swooping, streamlined mid-century American forms that look fast even when standing still. Bodies swell into deep curves with long sweeping arcs and a sculpted, bulging mid-section, balanced by fat, wide, generously rounded volumes with cream accents. Deep candy enamel in cherry red, turquoise, cream and black, edged with fine white pinstripes. Generous bright chrome on every edge and trim line, with a tall chrome flourish at the rear. Wide, swept-back, relaxed shapes, plush padded surfaces and small playful tassel or fin details. Jet-age optimism and showroom shine.'),
('Raleigh','Europe','1950s-70s','bicycles','In the style of Raleigh, sturdy, upright, practical British engineering with quiet dignity. Slim steel members in deep racing green, black or maroon glossy enamel, with fine hand-lined gold pinstripes at the joints and a small enamelled badge showing a bird. Full chrome covers over moving parts, sprung brown leather with brass or copper rivets, cream accents and tall, upright proportions. Parts are exposed, honest and repairable, with neat practical extras added. Rugged, reliable, rain-ready, sensible English craftsmanship with a post-war countryside feel.'),
('Boeing','North America','1960s-present','aircraft','In the style of Boeing, clean, confident, bright aluminium-and-white American jet-age engineering. Long smooth tubular volumes with a gently rounded front and a slightly raised forward swell, swept-back lines and large cylindrical forms in white and silver. White upper surfaces over polished bare metal, a grey tip, one narrow deep blue stripe running the full length above a tidy row of small round-cornered openings, and one tall element carrying a single large bold colour mark. Precise seams, crisp edges and white hardware. Optimistic, orderly, dependable and modern.'),
('Airbus','Europe','1990s-present','aircraft','In the style of Airbus, smooth, calm, computer-drawn European modernism. A perfectly round tubular body ending in a blunt, softly rounded front, with dark glazing wrapped in a sleek black swoosh. Slim swept lines with upturned tips that curve skyward, large round underslung volumes, and one tall element in bold colour. Clean white finish with a restrained palette of blue and white, a neat line of small rounded openings and flush, seamless surfaces. Uncluttered, cool, efficient and quietly high-tech, with a gentle sense of digital precision.'),
('de Havilland','Europe','1930s-50s','aircraft','In the style of de Havilland, light, nimble, gracefully proportioned British forms of the 1930s to 1950s. Slim bodies with smooth wooden curves, elliptical outlines and softly curved cowls that hug what is inside. Taut fabric surfaces in silver, with bright trainer yellow for contrast, and aluminium panels left bare and polished. Glazed bubble forms, fish-like pod shapes on twin booms, and simple round roundel marks in red, white and blue. Streamlined, clean and elegant, craftsman-built, with a hopeful pre-war and post-war amateur-flyer charm.'),
('Supermarine','Europe','1930s-40s','aircraft','In the style of Supermarine, sleek, purposeful British aerodynamic purity of the 1930s and 1940s. Graceful elliptical curves, a long slim front, a tapered rear and a narrow stance, all in polished metal skin with flush rivets. Wartime camouflage in dark green and earth brown on top with pale sky blue below, bright round markings in red, white and blue, and for racing, glossy blue and silver lacquer with long slender supports. Rounded bubble glazing and fine, thin lines. Fast-looking, elegant, lean and precise, pared down to speed alone.'),
('Cessna','North America','1960s-70s','aircraft','In the style of Cessna, friendly, simple, practical light design from the 1960s and 1970s. A boxy but approachable white body with strut-braced elements, large windows wrapping around the cabin, a tall angular rear and streamlined fairings over the wheels. Painted racing stripes sweep along the sides in red, blue, gold or green, with small neat registration-style numbers. Plain, honest shapes, easy to read, sturdy and unfussy, with a casual weekend-flyer optimism and a utility-first, general aviation feel.'),
('Sikorsky','North America','1950s-70s','helicopters','In the style of Sikorsky, rugged, heavy-duty, utilitarian machinery. A big rounded, bulbous front with deep glazing, a tall central mast carrying thick blades, and a long tapering tail ending in a small rotor. Stubby side pods, large intake and exhaust fairings and riveted aluminium skin with visible fasteners. Colour is either matte olive drab and grey for military work, or white and red for rescue, with big black and white stencilled numbers and warnings. No ornament, everything functional, strong, workmanlike and built to lift and endure.'),
('Concorde','Europe','1970s','aircraft','In the style of Concorde, a needle-sharp, supersonic, futuristic elegance of the 1970s. A tall, slender white body narrowing to a long pointed tip that droops downward, with tiny oval windows in a slim line. A pure, smooth, ogival delta outline sweeps back into a tapered end, with sharp rectangular housings tucked beneath. White paint is relieved only by one thin blue line along the sides. Knife-slim, bird-like, pared-back and aerodynamic, with a refined, rarefied air of speed and luxury.'),
('Kenworth','North America','1970s-present','trucks','In the style of Kenworth, proud, polished, long-nosed American heavy-duty highway presence. A tall, upright chrome face set in a long flat sloping front with bright chrome edge strips, big rectangular chrome mirrors, round lamps and a heavy chrome bar with a visor above the glazing. Two tall stainless columns rise at the back. Deep two-tone paint split by a bold stripe, polished aluminium wheels and a roomy rear cabin. Everything is gleaming, mirrored and meticulously cared for, with a bold, confident, king-of-the-road stance.'),
('Peterbilt','North America','1970s-present','trucks','In the style of Peterbilt, a showy, sculpted, long-nosed American heavy-duty look. A long, curved front with a bold oval chrome face, vertical louvres and rounded corners, single round chrome-ringed lamps, and curved sweeping wings over the wheels. Tall chrome columns, a big chrome bar, polished metal covers and a spacious rear cabin. Brilliant candy paint in black, red, blue or green is trimmed with fine pinstripes and gold lines. Classic, bold, polished and proud, with a strong highway stance and lots of mirror-bright metal.'),
('Scania','Europe','2000s-present','trucks','In the style of Scania, clean, crisp, modern Nordic engineering with a tall, flat-fronted, upright face. A broad, wide front crossed by one bold horizontal bar, narrow angular lamps and a wide, tall windscreen. Rounded roof forms with deflectors, long side skirts and tidy lines that flow back along the body. A silver and blue crowned winged-beast emblem sits centred on the front. Colour is tidy and solid, in white, red, blue or yellow, with no clutter. Rational, tidy, safe, practical and quietly premium.'),
('Mack Trucks','North America','1950s-present','trucks','In the style of Mack Trucks, blunt, tough, muscular American heavy-duty character. A bulldog-like nose, a top line that curves down steeply, and a bold chrome standing animal ornament on top. A stout upright chrome face with horizontal bars, round chrome lamps, short heavy wings, a thick chrome bar and a stubby cab. Bright enamel in red, yellow, blue or black, with stainless columns. Chunky, compact, solid and no-nonsense, proportioned like a determined fighter, with polished metal highlights on a hard-working frame.'),
('John Deere','North America','1950s-present','tractors','In the style of John Deere, robust, hard-working, clean agricultural design. Deep green bodywork with bright yellow wheels and trim, forming one memorable two-colour pairing. Boxy forms with a vertical slatted face, rounded caps, large deep-lugged rubber, a tall exhaust column and open or glazed operator areas. A bold leaping deer mark sits on the side in yellow. Simple yellow stripes and clean decals accent the green. Practical proportions, honest function, tidy, dependable and rooted in the countryside.'),
('Fendt','Europe','2000s-present','tractors','In the style of Fendt, premium, precise German farm engineering in glossy, bright lime green with matte black accents. High-polish paint, sleek rounded lines and sharply cut angular LED light strips. A big glass cabin with a curved panoramic windscreen, a metallic silver and black face with one wide horizontal slot, and minimal clutter across clean, tight bodywork. Large tyres and exact panel gaps suggest sharp machining. Modern, upmarket, tidy, high-tech and confident, like agricultural luxury.'),
('Massey Ferguson','Europe','1950s-70s','tractors','In the style of Massey Ferguson, plain, sturdy post-war farm machinery. Bright red bodywork with grey wheels, chassis and engine, a rounded top line with a vertical slatted face, chunky deep-tread rubber and an exposed exhaust pipe. A simple open seat with a basic wheel, or a small safety cab. Bold block lettering sits on the side. Two strong colours, red and grey, are used flat and simply. Honest, tough, utilitarian, no frills, and rooted in mid-century working farmland.'),
('Routemaster','Europe','1950s-60s','buses','In the style of Routemaster, nostalgic, rounded, sturdy London transport design. Deep pillar-box red paint with a cream or pale band dividing the two levels, a boxy body with big curved corners and a tall rounded front with a simple radiator-style face. An open rear platform with a pole, large display boxes above the glazing, a roundel and fleet number on the side, and deep sliding windows. Route numbers use stencil-like, bold lettering. Civic, familiar, friendly and proudly old-fashioned.'),
('Greyhound','North America','1950s-60s','buses','In the style of Greyhound, optimistic mid-century American road-travel streamlining. A stainless steel body with long fluted, corrugated sides, a low rounded roof and large tinted windows. A leaping dog silhouette appears in the side panels. Colour is blue and silver with white stripes. Polished aluminium panels, rounded edges and a smooth, speed-minded profile. Shiny, practical, spacious, modern-for-its-time and full of highway confidence.'),
('Great Western Railway','Europe','1930s','railways','In the style of Great Western Railway, proud Victorian-inspired engineering elegance. Gleaming Brunswick green paint with orange and black lining, polished brass domes and covers, a copper-capped chimney, a black smoke-dark front and a red base with number plates. Tall brass-edged nameplates sit on the curved wheel covers. Secondary elements are cream and chocolate brown. Metal is hand-polished, lines are fine and hand-drawn, and every part is crafted to be admired. Stately, dignified, traditional and richly finished.'),
('Shinkansen','East Asia','1960s-present','railways','In the style of Shinkansen, calm, ultra-precise, aerodynamic Japanese high-speed modernity. A long, smooth, continuous body ending in a duck-bill or beak-shaped nose, with a rounded cross-section and flush windows and doors. White bodywork carries one thin blue or colour stripe along the windows. A narrow wraparound front window, low skirts hiding the working parts, and near-seamless, polished surfaces. Quiet, futuristic, tidy and disciplined, where every curve serves speed and silence.'),
('TGV','Europe','1980s','railways','In the style of TGV, sleek, French, wedge-shaped, high-speed modernism of the 1980s. A pointed, sloped nose with a small oval window set deep in the front, a long tapering roof and a tightly articulated slim body. Colour is orange and silver-grey, with a bold orange lower band and a dark grey roof. Windows are flush, surfaces are smooth, and the profile is low, streamlined and futuristic. Confident, athletic, sporty, sharply tailored and engineered for speed.'),
('Orient Express','Europe','1920s-30s','railways','In the style of Orient Express, opulent, romantic 1920s-30s luxury travel. Deep royal blue panels with gold lettering and fine gold lining, a rounded barrel roof and polished brass rails. Interiors glow with glossy varnished teak and mahogany, marquetry panels, brass racks, burgundy velvet, crisp white linen, crystal and silver. Art deco lamps have frosted glass tulip shades. Everything is lacquered, gilded and carefully made. Atmosphere is glamorous, intimate, mysterious and unhurried.'),
('Riva','Europe','1960s','boats','In the style of Riva, glamorous, glossy Italian Riviera luxury of the 1960s. Long, slim, low forms in deep mahogany, with varnished surfaces in bright caramel grain, finished to mirror gloss. Curved, polished chrome frames and fittings, white leather or cream and red upholstery, and fine white or gold pinstripes. Swept rear lines, rounded curves and small neat flourishes. Handmade, sensual, sleek, sunlit and richly refined, with a jet-set summer feel.'),
('Chris-Craft','North America','1930s-50s','boats','In the style of Chris-Craft, classic, varnished, lakeside summer glamour in the 1930s-50s American tradition. Rich red-brown mahogany planking polished to a deep shine, with fine white caulked seams between boards. Chrome-framed glazing, chrome fittings and lights, slim tapering lines and rounded ends with a script nameplate. Tufted leather seating in red and cream, and neatly curved enclosures. Handcrafted, warm, nostalgic, sporty and carefree, like long sunny weekends on calm water.'),
('Sunseeker','Europe','2000s-present','boats','In the style of Sunseeker, sleek, low, sporty British luxury. A raked, aggressive forward slope, long white glossy surfaces, and dark tinted wraparound glazing. Bold swooping stripes sweep along the sides, with polished stainless rails and teak-clad surfaces. Upper levels have sunbathing pads and loungers. Interiors are lacquered in cream leather and high-gloss wood. Speed-minded, status-conscious, polished and flamboyant, with a high-glamour marina look and a cool white palette.'),
('Boston Whaler','North America','1960s-present','boats','In the style of Boston Whaler, honest, tough, practical, unsinkable simplicity. Wide, stable, twin-hull forms in white gelcoat with a thin navy or blue stripe low on the sides and a high flared front. Simple central arrangements with a stainless rail and leaning post, grey non-slip surfaces and a small control point. Holders and cleats are neatly bolted on. No fuss, no ornament, durable, utilitarian, ready for work or play, with a straightforward coastal feel.'),
('NASA','North America','1960s-70s','spacecraft','In the style of NASA, clean, technical, optimistic American spaceflight of the 1960s and 1970s. Tall white forms with bold black patterns, small flags in red, white and blue, and golden foil-wrapped conical shapes. Bright white surfaces with orange or silver details. Logo styles are either a red worm-like lettering or a blue circle with stars and a swoosh. Riveted aluminium panels, dark glossy heat-shield surfaces, exposed cabling and bell shapes, all against black space. Engineered, heroic, hopeful and precise.'),
('SpaceX','North America','2010s-present','spacecraft','In the style of SpaceX, minimalist, gleaming, modern reusable spaceflight. Smooth white cylinders with clean bold finishes, or polished bare stainless steel, with slender black legs and black sections. Lower parts are sooty and streaked with carbon from fiery returns. A rounded tip, slim grid shapes, a tapered capsule with a black heat shield and minimal bold sans-serif lettering. Few marks, no ornament, only function. Sleek, futuristic, confident, utilitarian and quietly daring.'),
('Soviet space programme','Russia and Eastern Europe','1960s','spacecraft','In the style of Soviet space programme, blunt, heavy, utilitarian 1960s industrial heroism. Round spherical forms with portholes, bare pea green and metallic silver surfaces, a cluster of tapering volumes hugging a central core, and brushed orange-tinted foil. White sections carry stencilled numbers, with bold red capital lettering and a red star or hammer-like mark. Visible cables, rivets and welded seams. Raw, practical, monumental, heavy-engineered and undecorated, with a stern, proud Cold War mood.'),
('Pullman','North America','1900s-30s','railways','In the style of Pullman, formal Gilded Age elegance in luxury travel of the early 1900s. Deep dark green paint with elaborate gold-leaf lettering and lines along the sides, an arched roof with small high windows, and an open rear platform with a railing. Interiors in walnut with green or burgundy plush upholstery, brass fittings and gaslight-style lamps. Heavy steel-clad forms are solid and stately. Ornate, rich, ceremonial, hand-gilded and imposing, like a rolling grand hotel.'),
('Piaggio Ape','Europe','1950s-60s','trucks','In the style of Piaggio Ape, tiny, quaint, cheerful Italian village practicality. Rounded compact forms on three wheels, simple handlebar or small bench controls, and a small tin utility area behind. Pressed-steel body in pastel mint, cream, light blue or sun-faded yellow, with rounded wings, tiny glazing and chrome trim around a single round lamp. Simple, humble, charming, slightly worn and friendly, built for narrow lanes and daily errands.'),
('Zeppelin','Europe','1920s-30s','aircraft','In the style of Zeppelin, stately, monumental, silver-giant 1920s-30s elegance. An enormous cigar-shaped form stretched taut over a light frame, covered in silvery aluminium-doped cloth, with a small streamlined pod underneath and rows of windows. Cruciform tail shapes, pods on struts and bold black Gothic lettering along the length, plus a red flag at the rear. Smooth, gleaming, serene and huge, with a majestic, floating, slow-moving presence and a dignified period grandeur.'),
('Noritake','East Asia','1910s-1930s','ceramics','In the style of Noritake, refined, ornate, glittering early twentieth century export porcelain. Glossy bone-white glaze with a faint bluish translucency, formal shapes with scalloped edges, closed loops, small curls and bud or fruit finials. Hand-painted and gilded decoration with wide borders of heavy gold, cobalt blue and deep rose red, central scenic panels in sunset orange and teal, and raised enamel dots and beads standing proud like pearls. Later Art Deco versions turn angular, with stepped triangles, black and orange bands, fans, sunbursts and pearly rainbow lustre. Slightly nostalgic, treasured and cabinet-worthy.'),
('Shiseido','East Asia','1910s-1930s','cosmetics','In the style of Shiseido, luxurious, feminine, carefully composed Taisho and early Showa elegance where Art Nouveau curves meet Art Deco geometry. Slim, faceted glass-like forms with domed tops, gilt metal accents, and lacquer red or ivory surfaces tied with ribbon. Graphics use a stylised camellia-like flower mark in white or gold on red, thin hand-drawn lettering in an Art Nouveau block script, sinuous floral borders and flat-colour illustrations of slender women with swept-up hair, in muted rose, jade green, indigo and warm cream. Gold foil edging, delicate line work, soft monochrome theatrical photography, and generous empty margins around small precise motifs.'),
('Zojirushi','East Asia','1970s-present','appliances','In the style of Zojirushi, gentle, practical, trustworthy Japanese domestic design. Plump rounded forms with soft corners in cream white, pearl grey or brushed stainless steel, with a single dark glass or black panel carrying small pale green backlit marks and simple rounded controls. Slim cylinders in satin steel or soft pastel enamel and sturdy folding handles. The mark is a small side-view elephant silhouette beside a red or black wordmark in friendly rounded letters. Surfaces are matte or satin, never flashy, with fine seams and tidy joints. Tiny line pictograms. Clean, quietly cheerful and reassuringly well made.'),
('Tamiya','East Asia','1970s-1980s','toys','In the style of Tamiya, precise, enthusiastic, sunny hobbyist modelmaking of the 1970s and 1980s. Illustration shows one subject in rich realism on a plain white ground, with crisp edges, glossy highlights, believable dirt, rust and exhaust staining, and dramatic low angles, framed by a thin black border with clean black, red and blue sans-serif lettering. Parts have sharp rivets, hexagonal bolt heads, fine panel lines and neat decals in white, red and yellow. Glossy shells in bright racing red, yellow and white with big stripes and number roundels, over chunky details, silver metal parts and exposed black structure. Tidy exploded line drawings.'),
('Kewpie','East Asia','1925-present','food','In the style of Kewpie, cute, wholesome, babyish and nostalgic Japanese branding built around a chubby baby mascot. Soft squeezable forms in clear or translucent white plastic with bright red accents and star-shaped detailing that makes fine ridged lines. Surfaces are mostly white with a red wordmark and a small round doll figure with a cheerful face, wide-set eyes, rosy cheeks, plump belly, tiny wings and a single curled tuft of hair, drawn in simple flat outline with pink and cream fill. Net-like orange-red cross-hatched lattice patterns appear. Pale yellow backgrounds, egg-yolk golds, a limited red, yellow and white palette and a clean modern photographic finish.'),
('Yakult','East Asia','1960s-present','food','In the style of Yakult, clean, bright, hygienic, friendly miniature design. A squat pale form about the size of a thumb joint, with a rounded shoulder and a ribbed faceted waist like a small cut-glass tumbler. A glossy white surface carries a bold red wordmark, a soft pink and blue accent band, a small drop motif and tiny black fine print. Items are bundled in tight multiples or lined in rows so the red and white pattern repeats. Plenty of white, pale pink, one hot red accent and a mild medical-nutrition feeling.'),
('Nissin Foods','East Asia','1970s-1980s','food','In the style of Nissin Foods, cheap, fast, fun, nostalgic 1970s-80s instant design. Saturated, appetising, slightly garish colour in hot red, mustard yellow, black and white. Big italic chunky lettering in red outlined in white or black, shiny metallic film striped in red and yellow, and thick sans-serif titles slanting upward. Bright photos or illustrations of steaming food, a round window showing golden crimped detail, and starburst flashes shouting new or tasty. Late-night convenience-store shelf energy.'),
('Tomica','East Asia','1970s-1980s','toys','In the style of Tomica, tidy, bright, practical, collectable and slightly retro miniature diecast design. Small compact forms in one glossy solid enamel colour such as white, red, yellow, light blue or metallic silver, with clear glazing, silver painted trim, tiny printed badges and parts that really open. Chrome five-spoke details on small black rubber. Everyday subjects keep real-world colour schemes with painted stripes and lettering. Presentation uses a picture window, black with yellow, later red and white, with an illustrated action scene, white sans-serif naming and a number tab.'),
('Namco','East Asia','1980s','games','In the style of Namco, cheerful, bouncy, golden-age arcade charm of the early 1980s. Characters are simple round shapes with big expressive eyes, drawn in a chunky low-resolution pixel grid on pure black. A yellow circle with a wedge mouth chases glowing dots through a neon blue outlined maze of rounded corridors, pursued by pastel ghosts in red, pink, cyan and orange with wavy skirts and blinking white eyes. Flat bright pixel-art fruit. Symmetrical insect-like shapes in blue, purple and yellow move in formation against single twinkling stars. Cartoon side art, a slanted black glowing logo, scanlines, limited saturated colours and hard pixel edges.'),
('Korg','East Asia','1970s-1980s','instruments','In the style of Korg, functional, technical, compact, precise late 1970s and 1980s electronic design with a futuristic hi-fi flavour. Long, shallow wedge shapes with a slanted metal control surface in brushed or anodised charcoal and silver, covered in rows of small round knobs, chunky slider caps and tiny lever switches in orange, red, blue and white. Labels are screen-printed in clean white or orange sans-serif capitals with thin line diagrams of waves and signal routing. Side cheeks are dark stained wood or black vinyl. Cream white and matte black, square-edged elements. Small red digits and amber or green indicators glow. Cool grey digital mood.'),
('Kubota','East Asia','1960s-present','machinery','In the style of Kubota, sturdy, dependable, tidy and slightly cheerful machinery in a single unmistakable colour scheme. Body panels are bright safety orange in glossy even enamel over dark grey or black structure and covers. Short rounded noses with slatted faces, rectangular work lights, slim chrome columns, flat step surfaces and high-backed black seats under canopies or glass cabs with big wraparound windows. Deep chevron-treaded rubber. The mark is a white capital wordmark on an orange rectangle, with a thin grey band along the side, small white numbers and yellow and black warning decals. Boxy, black rubber and bright steel, like well-maintained equipment resting in a green field.'),
('Asics','East Asia','1970s-1980s','footwear','In the style of Asics, athletic, light, vintage, understated, slightly nerdy-cool 1970s-80s Japanese performance design. Low, sleek forms in smooth suede mixed with light nylon mesh, slightly flared bases and gently curved ends. Two crossed diagonal stripes in a contrasting colour run along the side, usually white on navy, or red, yellow and blue on pale grey, with a thin scalloped overlay. Thick wedges of cream or white foam over crepe or waffle-patterned gum rubber. Earthy sporty colourways such as cream with burgundy, navy with sky blue, or grey with orange and lime. Small chunky italic white wordmarks with an Olympic-era retro feel.'),
('Calpis','East Asia','1950s-present','food','In the style of Calpis, clean, fresh, summery, childlike, retro design built on a polka dot pattern. An even field of round white dots on a rich blue ground, standing for a starry Milky Way, sometimes inverted to blue dots on white. A bold simple wordmark sits in a rounded white or blue rectangle in a soft rounded sans-serif. Tall slim shapes with narrow necks, wrapped in thin paper bearing the dots, or the same pattern at a larger scale with a glossy finish. Cloudy white tones, a pale blue ribbon of colour behind. Flavour variants shift accents to orange, peach and green but keep the dots. Limited blue and white palette, gentle geometry.'),
('Citizen Watch','East Asia','1980s-2010s','watches','In the style of Citizen Watch, reliable, modern, understated, engineered and quietly elegant Japanese precision. Round or slightly cushion shapes in brushed and polished stainless steel or titanium, with flat clear glass and slim rims. Clean legible faces in silver white, deep navy, black or champagne, with applied baton markers, sharp sword-shaped pointers with pale luminous fill and a fine printed track. Sporty variants add alternating smooth and serrated sections, bold luminous dots and rugged links. Dress versions use lacquered black, mother-of-pearl or paper-textured white with raised star or moon motifs. Brushed surfaces with polished edges. Tidy thin capital text, cool metallic shine, lit from above.'),
('Taiwan Beer','East Asia','1970s-present','drinks','In the style of Taiwan Beer, cheerful, social, straightforward and hot-evening, with strong green, gold and white colour blocking. Brown glass with a white and green paper surface bearing a small crest-like emblem, a bold sans-serif wordmark and a golden ring of wheat. Premium versions switch to gold and white, a medal version uses green glass with white, red and green. Metal finishes carry white with blue stripes and green lettering, or glossy gold, blue and white. Imagery includes ears of malted barley, a gleaming gold medal rosette and foam-topped glasses against a plain pale ground. Log-cabin style halls with wooden beams, long benches, round tables and neon green signs.'),
('Kweichow Moutai','East Asia','1950s-present','drinks','In the style of Kweichow Moutai, formal, festive, prosperous and traditional ceremonial design. A squat cylindrical white porcelain form with a short neck, glossy milk-white glaze and a slight shoulder curve, topped with a red ribbon tied over a seal and often a tiny hanging tag. A bright vermilion band wraps the middle, edged in gold, with large black or gold brush-style characters and a flowing line of small text. Special editions use red glaze, blue and white, or glossy black. Lacquer red or wood with yellow silk lining, embossed in gold and closed with a white cord or golden bow. Auspicious red, gold and white against dark polished tables.'),
('Flying Pigeon','East Asia','1960s-1980s','vehicles','In the style of Flying Pigeon, utilitarian, durable, plain, communal and nostalgic mid-century Chinese roadster design. Black enamelled steel diamond frames, with a double top line on the gents form or a low step-through loop on the ladies form. Large wheels with chrome rims and thin spokes, full covers over moving parts, a black rack with a leather pad, curved guards ending in pale cream tips and rod-operated mechanisms. Black leather on big coil springs, wide upright sweeping bars with black grips. White pinstripes and gold-lined transfers, a stylised dove head badge, and thick cream-walled or black rubber. Muted monochrome palette of black, chrome and cream, seen in long dense rows.'),
('White Rabbit Creamy Candy','East Asia','1950s-present','food','In the style of White Rabbit Creamy Candy, sweet, nostalgic, modest, childlike old Shanghai charm. Plump cream-coloured rectangles wrapped in a thin edible rice paper film, then in waxed paper twisted and printed in white with red, blue and black hand lettering in both Chinese characters and Latin script. A naturalistic ink drawing of a white rabbit stands before an old-fashioned artist palette, drawn with fine line shading in the manner of 1950s commercial art. Bright red and white with a large rabbit face, wide forward-looking eyes, a cartoonish cheerful animal on a pale blue sky ground. Vintage Art Deco borders. Limited white, red, blue and black palette with a slightly matte print texture.'),
('Tong Ren Tang','East Asia','Qing dynasty to present','retail','In the style of Tong Ren Tang, imperial, scholarly, aromatic, sombre and prosperous, like an old apothecary of lacquer, brass and paper. Long dark wooden lattice facades with carved eaves, lacquered red pillars, a horizontal black board with large gold brush calligraphy, tall hanging vertical signs and red paper lanterns. Interiors have floor-to-ceiling rows of small dark wood drawers with brass pulls and ink-labelled white tags, a high counter with brass scale and abacus, and glass jars of dried roots and flowers. Imperial yellow, vermilion red and gold with embossed dragon or lotus borders, traditional calligraphic characters and red seal stamps.'),
('Cathay Pacific','East Asia','1970s-2010s','airlines','In the style of Cathay Pacific, calm, urbane, polished, glassy and well-travelled design in green and white. A clean white body with a thin jade green line running below the windows, dark green accents and a calligraphic brush-stroke emblem like a swept bird wing curving upward in white or pale green. An earlier version used lettuce green and white two-tone with bare metal. Titles are in an upright dark green sans-serif wordmark with small simple Chinese script beside it. Interiors are quiet, with warm timber-toned panels, bottle green seats with pale covers, soft cream leather and thin gold accents. Crisp dark green uniforms with neat scarves. Harbour skyline at dusk.'),
('Hong Kong Tramways','East Asia','1950s-present','transport','In the style of Hong Kong Tramways, busy, nostalgic, neon-lit, crowded city design. Tall, slim, upright boxy bodies with two storeys of tall rectangular windows in slim frames, a slightly curved roof and open balcony fronts upstairs. Lower body in deep forest green with a cream or pale yellow stripe along the window line, and a square box with white characters on black. The most distinctive sight is the full-body advertising wrap in saturated colours, glossy photographs and bold Chinese and English lettering that covers the entire flank, so each object becomes a rolling poster. Interiors have wooden slatted seats, brass handrails and wooden floors.'),
('Star Ferry','East Asia','1950s-present','transport','In the style of Star Ferry, leisurely, nostalgic, salty and civic harbour charm. Low, broad forms with a rounded overhanging front, a white upper level and a narrow upper deck with a canvas or wooden awning, ringed by a thin white railing. Deep bottle green below clean white upperworks, with a gold rubbing strip, black cap, brass fittings and cream life rings. Names in white Latin letters and Chinese characters. Slatted wooden benches flip to face either way. Interiors show creamy paint, rows of varnished timber seats and round portholes. Green steel sheds with clock towers. Skyscrapers behind, hazy sky and dark teal water.'),
('Din Tai Fung','East Asia','2000s-present','food','In the style of Din Tai Fung, meticulous, hygienic, bustling and warm, with an exacting clean presentation. Small steamed parcels with paper-thin translucent skins, each gathered by hand into a tidy spiral of fine pleats with a little knot at the top, sitting in a round bamboo steamer with glints of broth showing. Open glass-walled kitchens show white-uniformed cooks in caps, masks and gloves under bright white light, working on stainless steel tables. Modern rooms have pale oak, blond wood screens, red brushed lettering signs, dark slate floors and slatted lanterns. Palette of cream, bamboo tan, steam white and one red accent.'),
('Lee Kum Kee','East Asia','1900s-present','food','In the style of Lee Kum Kee, trusted, family-run, festive and old-fashioned heritage design with dense decoration. Clear glass with a short neck, red accents and a wide wraparound surface in rich red with gold border lines. A circular central picture of a woman and a boy on a small flat boat on a river, drawn in a simplified storybook engraving with fine black outline and flat gold, green and cream fills, surrounded by the name in big golden brush strokes and Latin capitals. A gold ribbon banner and a small seal stamp repeat across the range. Red square gift tins with gold lettering and traditional pattern borders. Glossy dark brown tones, food shots with wok flames and shiny glazed meats.'),
('Li-Ning','East Asia','2000s-present','fashion','In the style of Li-Ning, energetic, patriotic, confident, youthful sportswear with bold national flavour mixing retro sports nostalgia and streetwear flair. A red geometric stroke like a flowing check mark or abstract athlete over bold red Chinese characters, often on white or black. Strong colour blocks of imperial red, black, white and metallic gold, with big rectangle patches and block lettering. Chunky soles with visible cushioning pods, bold geometric panels and ornate dragon-scale texture. Stand collars, broad contrast stripes down the arms and legs, glossy nylon and retro 1990s team colours in red, yellow and green. Calligraphy, cloud and dragon motifs, brocade panels and oversize shapes. Bright red with white text.'),
('Nongshim','East Asia','1980s-present','food','In the style of Nongshim, bold, hot, hearty, no-nonsense and late-night convenience-store feel. Deep red and black with a big photograph of glossy noodles in fiery red broth with floating slices of green onion, egg yolk and mushroom, set against a dark matte background. Titles are in heavy white and yellow Korean characters with a strong brush-like edge and a small character in a red square seal. A bright flame graphic and hot chilli accent signal spiciness. A small seed-shaped logo with an arc in red and green. Orange and yellow with cartoon accents. Saturated red, black and golden yellow.'),
('Gentle Monster','East Asia','2010s-present','eyewear','In the style of Gentle Monster, playful, futuristic, uncanny, theatrical and avant-garde. Oversized, sculptural forms in chunky glossy black, tortoise brown, milky translucent grey or pale pink, with thick geometric rims, rounded squares, pointed wings and big wraparound shields. Metal in silver or gold with fine joints, and tinted transparent areas in blue, green, orange or mirror gradient. Small engraved logo marks in tiny white capitals. Spaces are more art gallery than shop, with huge kinetic sculptures, robotic arms, animal-like figures, towering mirrored walls, glowing plant-like installations and surreal landscapes of foam, resin, concrete and silicone in stark white or black, with a single object placed like an artefact on a plinth. Moody, dramatically lit photography against odd backdrops.'),
('Korean Air','East Asia','1984-2024','airlines','In the style of Korean Air, orderly, polite, spacious, corporate and sky-high, with cool blue colours and a clean white body under a cloudless sky. White lower areas and a sky blue upper stripe over a wide silver-grey line, with a big round emblem of swirling red and blue halves twisting around each other. The title is a bold, rounded serif wordmark in light blue, in a heavy slab-like cut with quirky character. A later redesign shifts to a dark navy outlined emblem and a tidy sans-serif. Interiors in calm light blue and grey with white head cloths, warm wood-toned panels and cream carpeting. Light blue and white uniforms with neat scarves and pale gloves.'),
('Lotte Confectionery','East Asia','1960s-present','food','In the style of Lotte Confectionery, cute, light, childlike and refreshing, with flat colour, bold outlines, whimsical animals and a nostalgic convenience-store candy shelf. Slim mint green or cool blue shapes with a cartoon penguin on an iceberg wearing a tiny bow tie, drawn in smooth outline with a bright white belly. Small hexagonal forms in pastel blue and white with a round-eyed koala mascot in a different pose each time, and cream-filled bear-shaped shapes with a printed face. Rich red, gold and brown foil with an embossed curved wordmark. Bright orange, yellow and green with playful bouncing type. Glossy, graphic and clear surfaces.'),
('Amul','South Asia','1960s-present','food','In the style of Amul, witty, homey, playful, everyday-Indian and nostalgic, painted in mural style on wall and street. Small rectangular foil-wrapped forms in yellow with a red band, a bold red wordmark in rounded sans-serif capitals with a thick outline, and a little girl mascot with a blue polka dot dress, a red bow in blue-green hair, a button nose and a cheeky smile, drawn in clean cartoon ink lines. Posters in yellow or sky blue pair a witty cartoon with a bold hand-lettered headline in white or red on a stripe, and a tiny red logo tag in the corner. Flat poster-paint colour in strong saturated red, yellow, blue and white. Hand-painted, jaunty, slightly uneven lettering.'),
('Bajaj Auto','South Asia','1970s-1990s','vehicles','In the style of Bajaj Auto, cheerful, unpretentious, resilient and familiar, packed with colour and rattle on a dusty street. Rounded pressed-steel bodies with bulbous curves, a curved shield shape, vinyl-covered bench seating and a small spare wheel on the side. Thick glossy enamel in sky blue, cream, off-white, rust red and olive green, with chrome side badges, round chrome-rimmed lamps and stubby upright details. Tiny three-wheeled forms with canvas or sheet metal enclosures, open sides and a black fold-down hood, in lemon yellow and black, or green and yellow, with painted slogans and plastic flower garlands.'),
]
